The '''Theed Hangar''' was a spacious [[hangar]] attached to one side of the [[Theed Royal Palace|Royal Palace]] in [[Theed]], [[Naboo]],<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> that was constructed under the reign of [[King]] [[Bon Tapalo]].<ref name="BMF 24">{{BuildFalconCite|24|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> It was separated from the [[city]]'s [[plasma]] [[Theed power generator|power plant]] by a heavy blast-proof door, and housed the headquarters of both the [[Royal Naboo Security Forces]] and the [[Naboo Royal Space Fighter Corps]], two organizations that served the [[Royal House of Naboo]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> The roof of the hangar was blast-proof. Above the main hangar was a space that contained systems that could "burn out" enemy [[radar]] systems. This space was also used by air traffic controllers.<ref name=":0" />

The hangar could hold the [[J-type 327 Nubian royal starship|Royal Starship]] and at least twenty-seven [[N-1 starfighter]]s.<ref name=":0">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref>

